'''Metal Cat''' is a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 4.0 Update|Version 4.0]] and can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]]. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], it is only available when rolling in either [[UBERFEST (Gacha Event)/Switch Version|UBERFEST]] (SEA) or [[SUPERFEST (Gacha Event)/Switch Version|SUPERFEST]] (JP/WW) banners. 

